// Advancement dabloon economy, reviewed against BlazeandCave's Advancements Pack 1.21 Alpha Build 4.
// Unit: rewards are tuned for deliberate advancement-hunting effort from the game stage where the task is reasonable to attempt.
// Zero is reserved for normal progression or actions that commonly happen by accident; mob/skull/head rewards assume easy server drops.
{
